#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. Make sure your"
" face is well lit and centred, then try again -- or skip and add a mod"
"el later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Ilkinji modeliňiz ýatda saklandy, şonuň üçin ýüz girişi eýýäm işleýär."
" Faceüzüňiziň ýagtydygyna we merkezine göz ýetiriň, soňra gaýtadan syn"
"anyşyň - ýa-da soňra Sazlamalardan bir model goşuň."

#: src/onboarding.py:607
msgid "Add a face model (required)"
msgstr "Modelüz modelini goşuň (zerur)"

#: src/onboarding.py:609
msgid ""
"Face login needs at least one face model, so this scan can't be skippe"
"d. Record it in the light you usually sit in. Lighting changes how you"
"r face looks to the camera, so consider adding a second model later fr"
"om Settings, recorded in different light (for example evening lamps in"
"stead of daylight)."
msgstr ""
"Logüz girişine azyndan bir ýüz modeli gerek, şonuň üçin bu skanerden g"
"eçip bolmaz. Adatça oturan ýagtylygyňyzda ýazyň. Ingagtylyk, ýüzüňiziň"
" kameranyň keşbini üýtgedýär, şonuň üçin dürli ýagtylykda ýazylan sazl"
"amalardan soň ikinji modeli goşmagy göz öňünde tutuň (mysal üçin gündi"
"ziň ýerine agşam çyralary)."

#: src/onboarding.py:618
msgid "Add a second face model (recommended)"
msgstr "Ikinji ýüz modelini goşuň (maslahat berilýär)"

#: src/onboarding.py:620
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved. Lighting changes how your face looks to the"
" camera: a model recorded in daylight can fail in the evening under la"
"mps (or the other way round), and Ubuntu Hello then times out instead "
"of unlocking. A second model recorded in different light keeps recogni"
"tion reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Ilkinji modeliňiz ýazdyryldy. Ingagtylyk, ýüzüňiziň kameranyň keşbini "
"üýtgedýär: gündizine ýazylan model agşam lampalaryň aşagynda (ýa-da ba"
"şga ýol bilen) şowsuz bolup biler, we Ubuntu Hello soň gulpy açmagyň ý"
"erine birnäçe gezek öçüp biler. Dürli ýagtylykda ýazylan ikinji model,"
" günüň islendik wagtynda tanalmagy ygtybarly saklaýar."

#: src/onboarding.py:622
msgid ""
"Change the lighting first: switch the room light or desk lamp on or of"
"f, turn away from the window, or put on the glasses you sometimes wear"
". Then look straight into the camera and press Scan."
msgstr ""
"Ilki bilen yşyklandyryşy üýtgediň: otagyň çyrasyny ýa-da stol çyrasyny"
" ýakyň ýa-da öçüriň, penjireden ýüz öwüriň ýa-da käwagt geýýän äýnegiň"
"izi dakyň. Soňra göni kameranyň içine serediň we Scan basyň."

